    "content": "<div class=\"ml-en\"><span class=\"eyebrow\">ANC302 · Assessment 1/6</span>\n<h2>Assessment 1 ( Assessment 1.1 and Assessment 1.2)</h2>\n<p class=\"nhan\">Source: FLM syllabus 13434 · assessment table (verbatim)</p></div>\n<div class=\"ml-vi\"><span class=\"eyebrow\">ANC302 · Đầu điểm 1/6</span>\n<h2>Assessment 1 ( Assessment 1.1 and Assessment 1.2)</h2>\n<p class=\"nhan\">Nguồn: syllabus FLM 13434 · bảng đánh giá (nguyên văn)</p></div>\n<div class=\"kv-grid\">\n  <div class=\"kv\"><span class=\"k\">Type / Loại</span><span class=\"v\">on-going</span></div>\n  <div class=\"kv\"><span class=\"k\">Weight / Trọng số</span><span class=\"v\">20.0%</span></div>\n  <div class=\"kv\"><span class=\"k\">Parts / Số phần</span><span class=\"v\">1</span></div>\n  <div class=\"kv\"><span class=\"k\">Completion criteria / Điều kiện hoàn thành</span><span class=\"v\">&gt;0</span></div>\n  <div class=\"kv\"><span class=\"k\">Duration / Thời lượng</span><span class=\"v\">1 assignment/11 sessions/ in class and at home</span></div>\n  <div class=\"kv\"><span class=\"k\">CLO</span><span class=\"v\">CLO2,CLO7,CLO3</span></div>\n  <div class=\"kv\"><span class=\"k\">No. of questions / Số câu</span><span class=\"v\">Students are required to submit a PDF report that includes:Assignment 1.11. Character profile.2. The process and results of research leading to the design idea.3. Character mind map.4. An additional report describing the use of AI support, if applicable.Assignment 1.21. Six thumbnail sketches for each character.2. A detailed report on the process of comparison, evaluation, and revision to select the best thumbnail sketch.3. A size comparison between the two characters.4. An additional report describing the use of AI support, if applicable.</span></div>\n  <div class=\"kv\"><span class=\"k\">Knowledge &amp; skill / Kiến thức &amp; kỹ năng</span><span class=\"v\">- Gesture construction - the thumbnail process</span></div>\n  <div class=\"kv\"><span class=\"k\">Grading guide / Hướng dẫn chấm</span><span class=\"v\">- Assessment Regulations<br><br>+ Assignments are first displayed and evaluated by students, then formally assessed and graded by the lecturer.<br><br>+ Students will receive guidance and support from the lecturer throughout the process.<br><br>-AI Usage Regulations<br><br>+ Students are allowed to use any generative AI tools to search for secondary data and generate ideas. However, they must independently construct the final product in accordance with the conditions and requirements of the assignment.<br><br>+ Students must submit an AI usage report describing the process, including screenshots that illustrate the steps taken.</span></div>\n  <div class=\"kv\"><span class=\"k\">Note / Ghi chú</span><span class=\"v\">Task<br><br>- Assessment 1.1:<br><br>+Students may use AI to support the research process and to generate reference materials about the character based on the established character profile.<br><br>+ Students conduct comparison, evaluation, and selection in order to propose a design idea.<br><br>+Students create a mind map for the character.<br><br>- Assessment 1.2:<br><br>+ 'Students create sketches or combine the use of AI support to produce at least six poses for each character in the form of thumbnails.<br><br>+ 'Students conduct comparison, evaluation, and revision to produce the best thumbnail sketch<br><br>+ Presentation</span></div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"ml-en\"><p class=\"ghi-chu\">No practice paper for this subject in the Exam Room yet.</p></div>\n<div class=\"ml-vi\"><p class=\"ghi-chu\">Phòng thi chưa có đề luyện cho môn này.</p></div>\n<div class=\"ml-en\"><div class=\"note-ct\">📝 Exam-strategy notes and worked past papers: coming later.</div></div>\n<div class=\"ml-vi\"><div class=\"note-ct\">📝 Chiến lược làm bài và chữa đề: sẽ bổ sung sau.</div></div>"
