    "content": "<div class=\"ml-en\"><span class=\"eyebrow\">ANC302 · Assessment 3/6</span>\n<h2>Assessment 3 (Assessment 3.1 and Assessment 3.2)</h2>\n<p class=\"nhan\">Source: FLM syllabus 13434 · assessment table (verbatim)</p></div>\n<div class=\"ml-vi\"><span class=\"eyebrow\">ANC302 · Đầu điểm 3/6</span>\n<h2>Assessment 3 (Assessment 3.1 and Assessment 3.2)</h2>\n<p class=\"nhan\">Nguồn: syllabus FLM 13434 · bảng đánh giá (nguyên văn)</p></div>\n<div class=\"kv-grid\">\n  <div class=\"kv\"><span class=\"k\">Type / Loại</span><span class=\"v\">on-going</span></div>\n  <div class=\"kv\"><span class=\"k\">Weight / Trọng số</span><span class=\"v\">10.0%</span></div>\n  <div class=\"kv\"><span class=\"k\">Parts / Số phần</span><span class=\"v\">1</span></div>\n  <div class=\"kv\"><span class=\"k\">Completion criteria / Điều kiện hoàn thành</span><span class=\"v\">&gt;0</span></div>\n  <div class=\"kv\"><span class=\"k\">Duration / Thời lượng</span><span class=\"v\">1 assignment/<br>10 sessions/ in class and at home ( The 3/4 Front view must be completed in class and submitted.)</span></div>\n  <div class=\"kv\"><span class=\"k\">CLO</span><span class=\"v\">CLO4</span></div>\n  <div class=\"kv\"><span class=\"k\">No. of questions / Số câu</span><span class=\"v\">Students are required to submit a PDF report that includes:<br>Assignment 3.1<br>1. Turnaround sketch of the character structure.<br>2. Turnaround costume sketch of the character.<br>3. Turnaround clean line drawings (finalized character).<br>4. An additional report describing the use of AI support, if applicable.<br>Assignment 3.2<br>1. At least 2 color concept sketches of the character in a 3/4 view.<br>2. Finalized color sketch of the character.<br>3. An additional report describing the use of AI support, if applicable.</span></div>\n  <div class=\"kv\"><span class=\"k\">Knowledge &amp; skill / Kiến thức &amp; kỹ năng</span><span class=\"v\">FORM Model-construction breakdown<br>DETAILS - Cleanup and color</span></div>\n  <div class=\"kv\"><span class=\"k\">Grading guide / Hướng dẫn chấm</span><span class=\"v\">- Displayed and evaluated by students first, then evaluated and graded by lecturer.<br>+ Evaluation criteria are based on the rubric attached to the course materials.<br>- Guided by instructor<br>-AI Usage Regulations<br>+ Students are allowed to use any generative AI tools to search for secondary data and generate ideas. However, they must independently construct the final product in accordance with the conditions and requirements of the assignment.<br>+ Students must submit an AI usage report describing the process, including screenshots that illustrate the steps taken.</span></div>\n  <div class=\"kv\"><span class=\"k\">Note / Ghi chú</span><span class=\"v\">Task<br>- Assessment 3.1:<br>+ Students are required to draw a turnaround of 5 basic views (Front, 3/4 Front, Side, 3/4 Back, Back) to show the character structure. (Students may use AI to generate visual references that support the imagination of the turnaround.)<br>+ Design costumes and details based on the established basic structure across the 5 views (Front, 3/4 Front, Side, 3/4 Back, Back). Note: The 3/4 Front view must be completed in class and submitted.<br>+ Complete clean line drawings for all 5 views.<br>- Assessment 3.2:<br>'Students are required to design the color concept of the character (AI may be used to generate visual references).</span></div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"ml-en\"><p class=\"ghi-chu\">No practice paper for this subject in the Exam Room yet.</p></div>\n<div class=\"ml-vi\"><p class=\"ghi-chu\">Phòng thi chưa có đề luyện cho môn này.</p></div>\n<div class=\"ml-en\"><div class=\"note-ct\">📝 Exam-strategy notes and worked past papers: coming later.</div></div>\n<div class=\"ml-vi\"><div class=\"note-ct\">📝 Chiến lược làm bài và chữa đề: sẽ bổ sung sau.</div></div>"
